{"product_id":"just-william","title":"Just William","description":"\u003cp\u003eIn Just William the Outlaws plan a day of non-stop adventure. The only problem is that William is meant to be babysitting. But William won't let that stop him having fun with his gang - he'll just bring the baby along! Now with a brand-new cover look illustrated by Chris Riddell. There is only one William. This tousle-headed, snub-nosed, hearty, loveable imp of mischief has been harassing his unfortunate family and delighting his hundreds of thousands of admirers since 1922. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:18 x 190  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Richmal Crompton \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781447285588 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 336\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44789657665689,"sku":"6RD9781447285588","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/c114682c191f00e0c681cc022d221b43.jpg?v=1724940560","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/just-william","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}